# Joketeller

A simple command-line application that tells you a random joke fetched from the [Official Joke API](https://official-joke-api.appspot.com/).

## Installation

To install the dependencies, run the following command:

```
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

## Usage

To get a random joke, run the following command:

```
python joketeller/main.py
```

## Running Tests

To run the tests, use the following command:

```
python joketeller/test_main.py
```
